  <author>zwift-coach</author>
  <name>Mon Nov 2 · Z2 pyramid 60min @ ~197W</name>
  <description>Z2 pyramid: 3-min steps up and down through Z2 with changing cadence. Avg ~197 W, cap 220 W outside sprinkles. Follow the on-screen cues.</description>
